  *                              descriptor information.
  * @param  pQueue       : [OUT] Pointer to a DMA_QListTypeDef structure that contains DMA linked-list queue
  *                              information.
  * @retval LPBAM Status : [OUT] Value from LPBAM_Status_t enumeration.
